  "description": "Dominica, a vampire hiding her true identity while living among humans, finds herself attacked one night by a vampire hunter named Aran. But instead of being his victim, she overpowers him—and ends up spending an unexpectedly thrilling night with her perfect match. Just when she thought their encounter would be a one-time thing, a string of mysterious incidents began to unfold in her territory. As Dominica hunts for the truth behind these events, she keeps running into Aran, and their fates become increasingly intertwined...\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
